WEBVTT

NOTE
Journey: Advocates - Week 5 Leader Video
Unit 2, Lesson 1: Worldview

1
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.520
So when I was 15, I remember going to my mom and sort of telling her like, I'm

2
