having a hard time like seeing what's in front of me.

3
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.580
I'm having a hard time seeing the board.

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:20.840
I didn't think much of it, you know, because I didn't really just didn't think much

5
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.080
of it. But I realized I'm sitting in the back of class and where I like to sit, I

6
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.560
couldn't see anything. And then it really got sort of serious when I started to

7
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:34.720
drive and I realized that some signs that I think I might be should be able to see

8
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:39.180
or my friends have told me about that I'm not seeing, something's not right.

9
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.380
And so I went to the doctors, went to the eye doctor, and they did all the little

10
00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:48.960
checks. They put the little thing on your face, and they do all the dialing, and you

11
00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.920
read the lines and the letters and all that kind of stuff.

12
00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.120
