00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:20.470
that you can navigate it as you go and you are increasing that level of trust and

143
00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.210
increasing the student's ability to ask the tough questions.

144
00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:28.910
You suddenly might fall back into old questions that were asked in

